  "card": "Extends getprivatebroadcastinfo to retain and report finished private broadcast transactions rather than dropping them immediately upon network receipt. Adds a received_by_us field indicating the peer address and timestamp when a transaction is echoed back from the network, and evicts the oldest finished transactions when the queue is full. Solves the lack of post-broadcast observability for operators using private transaction broadcast. No dependencies.",
